  'math.seoTitle': "Mental Math for Kids — a Free Online Trainer",
  'math.seoLead': "Mental math means calculating in your head with simple, reliable techniques. Here four techniques — addition, subtraction, multiplication and division — are explained step by step with examples from Torah lessons, and a trainer with three levels helps you practice them. And every day there is a “Gematria of the Day”: a Torah word whose letters you add up in your head. Free — for kids and parents.",
