  'shn.lead': "Every week we read the weekly parshah: each verse of the Torah twice and once the Aramaic translation of Onkelos. One portion a day: the first on Sunday, the seventh on Shabbat. The Torah verse appears twice in one font, the Targum (ת״א) in another.",
