  'abc.seoTitle': "The Hebrew alphabet in 5 minutes — 22 Hebrew letters: name, sound and numerical value",
  'abc.seoLead': "All 22 letters of the Hebrew alphabet (the Alef-Bet) and the 5 final forms in one table: what each letter looks like, its name, its sound and its number (gematria). Letters that are easy to mix up, and a 10-question quiz. Free, for children and adults.",
