  'consent.lead': "Your child has signed up on Niflaot — Torah lessons as games. With your consent the site keeps the child's email, nickname and lesson progress; the nickname and points are seen by the teacher of a class the child joins; they are not shown to other players. You can withdraw consent at any time: write to Office@mychitas.app or delete the account.",
