  'atlas.tlSource': "Years according to Seder HaDorot by R. Yechiel Heilprin (Warsaw, 1878; public domain, Sefaria export), based on Seder Olam Rabbah, and the Talmud (Zevachim 118b, Megillah 11b); for each king, the verse where his reign begins. A prophet stands in the row of the year he began to prophesy according to Seder HaDorot; where it gives no year or differs from the verse — in the row of the king under whom Tanakh names him.",
