  'ln.title': "Holy Tongue — lessons",
  'ln.menuSub': "step by step: letters and words",
  'ln.lead': "Step by step: the letters in two parts, then the vowel points and syllables — learning to read, then the Torah words — a portion at a time. A lesson takes five minutes and brings 5–6 new words: pick the meaning, find the pairs, build the word from its letters; at the end of the portion — a review.",
  'ln.leadAdults': "Step by step: the letters in two parts, then the vowel points and syllables — learning to read, then the most frequent words of Tanakh — levels of 50, as in “My words”: 10 lessons of 5 new words and a review. The words of a finished lesson go to “My words”: review them there and they count for the certificate.",
