  'tanakh.seo.open': "Open the passage of the day",
  'tanakh.seo.what': "For every verse: the vocalized Hebrew, a translation and the plain explanation of Metzudat David (Rashi if you like). The passage can be printed. After reading — tick “I’ve read it” and take the “Questions on the passage”; for all the passages of a book the Niflaot Academy gives an “Expert in the book” certificate.",
