  'tanakh.seo.have4': "Metzudat David, the plain meaning of each verse — in Hebrew in every book (in Ruth, Eichah and Esther, where it does not exist, Rashi); in English, Russian and German — the project’s translation, a week ahead: ready through {until}.",
